    equations: ["U = sum(C_i / T_i)", "RMS sufficient bound: U <= n * (2^(1/n) - 1)  (n = 3 -> 0.7798)", "Response time: R_i = C_i + sum over higher-priority j of ceil(R_i / T_j) * C_j"],
